
# ML Continuous Integration Project

## Objective
Automate the build and testing process of a Machine Learning application using GitHub Actions.

## Tools Used
- GitHub and GitHub Actions
- Python 3.11
- Scikit-learn
- Pytest
- Joblib

## CI Workflow
1. Checkout the repository.
2. Set up Python and install dependencies.
3. Train the Machine Learning model.
4. Run automated test cases.
5. Display the build report.
6. Upload the model and build report as artifacts.

## Result
The CI workflow automates model training, testing, and artifact generation.
